Includes the editor/navigation strand (Notepad++ support, coordinate teleporting, zoom — 2023) and the platform strand (API server, Scroll Sync, partitions, P2P — Dec 2023). Momentum is real and checkable: libphext-rs v0.5.0 published to crates.io (2026-11-08), Phext Edit live at v1.1.1 with a Product Hunt launch (2026-11-10), SQ hosting, phextura begun. What remains of the wish is the "everywhere" part: every language, the filesystem/SQL layer proven at scale, and adoption beyond the first circle.

