Title: Depth behind every cell — a 3D phext demo for ASCII game maps (for @paleoludic)
Source: workspace/paleoludic-demo/README.md
Inscribed: 2026-11-14
SHA-256: 7ac0f512f72746acda1aa1f4f29b026e0c212dc1a22365676abacdf62d91d98e

