Title: Stage 8 — The Generative Turn: How It Improves Phext
Source: ~/workspace/nethack-solver/stage8-phext-report.md
Inscribed: 2026-11-15
SHA-256: 8856c85c50bc591901424dbc119248f572a4421c18be68b95d0cf9b673bc0157

